docs {
  # Finance → Reports

  The five report screens (`/finance/reports/*`): **Billing**, **Collection**,
  **Outstanding**, **Refund**, **Cancel**. All share one config-driven engine on
  the frontend.

  Only **Billing** is backend-wired (Phase 1). The others are frontend-only /
  mock — their subfolders are placeholders until their aggregate endpoints exist.
}
